```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "co-sign one keeper commit as the face's ward vest"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///face.keeper.cosigns", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.keeper.cosigns"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.keeper.cosigns"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.keeper.cosigns ~ keeper-cosign ~ the keeper vest's co-sign

`lares intent keeper-cosign <sha256:D> prev=<chain head|none> nonce=<64 hex>` issues (or reads back) the face's ward co-sign over one keeper commit and prints the carried co-sign as JSON; the host shim gathers each lit face's into the successor.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ cosign

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`cosign` params=`next/sha256:<digest> prev/none nonce/<hex> ~ co-sign the founding link`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ next · prev · nonce · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`next` params=`takes/digest needs/required seat/1 as/<next> ~ the successor closure, sha256:<64 hex>`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`prev` params=`takes/hash needs/required ~ the chain head (64 hex), or none at the founding link`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nonce` params=`takes/hex needs/required ~ the commit's nonce, 64 hex`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ the face whose intent plane this reads or writes, a whole persona index from 0`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand key/face-atom ~ signs under the face's own atom key through the store door`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · face-malformed · face-not-held · keeper-cosign-prev-malformed · keeper-cosign-nonce-malformed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`~ an unknown sub-verb, or no sub-verb named`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-malformed` params=`~ --face names a whole persona index from 0`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-not-held` params=`~ this vessel holds no such face`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`keeper-cosign-prev-malformed` params=`~ the chain head reads 64 hex, or none`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`keeper-cosign-nonce-malformed` params=`~ the nonce reads 64 hex`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ cosign

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`cosign` params=`exit/0 ~ the carried co-sign prints as JSON`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares intent keeper-cosign

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares intent keeper-cosign]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

